  "description": "RISWAT crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C10 H20 Ce6 N2 O37,9.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 9 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce4 (Ce) has 9 O neighbors; Ce5 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce6 (Ce) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.718-3.858 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.90-120.53°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ce6(μ3-O)4(μ3-OH)4(HCOO)10(NO3)2(H2O)3]·(H2O)9.5. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 9 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
